ocpp-tap
========

This repository contains code copied from another project. The copies have
been modified since and are maintained here independently.

Source:  https://github.com/wolffseb/headless-csms
Commit:  603c2d112c736ff98e44844a57fb63dbda7096e3
License: MIT (reproduced below)

Copied files (source path -> path here):

  internal/ocpp/ocpp.go                  -> internal/ocpp/ocpp.go
  internal/ocpp/chargepoint.go (excerpt: ErrTimeout, ErrNotConnected)
                                         -> internal/ocpp/errors.go
  internal/ocpp/ocppj/frame.go           -> internal/ocpp/ocppj/frame.go
  internal/ocpp/ocppj/frame_test.go      -> internal/ocpp/ocppj/frame_test.go
  internal/ocpp/ocppj/conn.go            -> internal/ocpp/ocppj/conn.go
  internal/ocpp/ocppj/conn_test.go       -> internal/ocpp/ocppj/conn_test.go

Modifications: import paths rewritten from github.com/wolffseb/cli-cpms to
github.com/wolffseb/ocpp-tap; ocppj.Options.Observe (raw-frame hook)
added for the test harness; see git history for later changes.

The test harness also runs (but does not copy) the `cpms` binary built from
the same repository at the commit pinned in the Makefile.

